      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e1",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "We used the PICO (Population, Intervention, Comparison, Outcome) search format: Among adults with cardiac arrest in any setting (OHCA or IHCA) who qualify for ECPR by inclusion and exclusion parameters outlined ... (O). Contemporary studies from January 2000 to June 2021 were included. ... Studies with ≤ 5 patients receiving ECPR or studies that did not report the inclusion or exclusion criteria regarding the eligibility of ECPR or the timing of ECPR (i.e. during or after cardiac arrest) were excluded. The primary outcome of interest was favourable neurological outcomes on discharge, using study-specified definitions. ... Secondary outcome included absolute survival irrespective of neurological outcome to the end of each study period.",
      "reason": "The eligibility criteria and key outcome timing (on discharge/end of study period) are specified using PICO, and eligible study designs are listed. However, the evidence does not clearly specify all study-characteristic components in the requested framework detail (e.g., comprehensive inclusion/exclusion specifics beyond what is quoted, and explicit setting/follow-up requirements beyond discharge/end of study)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "Contemporary studies from January 2000 to June 2021 were included. Only English language studies were included.",
      "reason": "The evidence specifies dissemination/report characteristics including date range (January 2000 to June 2021) and language (English). It does not explicitly mention publication/report status, so this is treated as present for the elements it covers."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence is provided describing whether exclusions were distinguished based on outcomes not measured versus outcomes not reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e4",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "Results are reported separately for pre-defined subgroups based on type of study (retrospective or prospective), and the location of cardiac arrest (IHCA vs OHCA).",
      "reason": "The evidence identifies groups used for analyses/synthesis (prospective vs retrospective; IHCA vs OHCA) as pre-defined subgroups, which correspond to the review’s comparisons by study design and arrest location."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "While notable eligibility restrictions are described (e.g., exclusion of studies with ≤ 5 patients; exclusion when inclusion/exclusion criteria or timing are not reported), the evidence does not provide rationales for those restrictions."
    }
